# The canonical indexer reads an explicit root .env.testnet profile only.
# Configure INDEXER_RPC_URL, INDEXER_POLICY_JSON, RPC_URL, RPC_TIMEOUT_MS,
# CHAIN_ID, NETWORK_MODE, TRADING_ENABLED=false, MARKET_DEPLOYMENT_START_BLOCK,
# LENDING_DEPLOYMENT_JSON, SUPABASE_URL, DATABASE_URL,
# DATABASE_SSL_CA_PATH and DATABASE_SSL_CA_SHA256 in that ignored file.
# No signer key or browser database write access is required.
